2026-09-28; this color revision awaits renewed visual review."},"modelingNotes":["IGN March 2023 returns and Roofer 1.0.0 LoD2.2 reconstruction provide semantic roof patches and the initial roof-height envelope. Missing perimeter strips are restored against the source footprint supplied to Roofer, simplified by 0.15 m. Original Roofer geometry is retained separately in baseline/.","Astra replaces the planar Roofer roof approximation with a locally fitted quadratic shell using only classified roof returns within 3 m of Roofer roof surfaces. Reserved 10 m cells are excluded from the curve fit; Roofer used the full cloud, so this is held-out refinement validation, not an independent end-to-end survey.","The 1991 inspected photograph supports a thin white shell and gridded structural glazing. Shell thickness 0.65 m, glazing setback 2 m and simplified frame spacing are visual inferences, not LiDAR measurements; modern doors, lettering and interiors are not reconstructed.","Z=0 is the robust 62.3205 m IGN69 surrounding plaza datum. Below-plaza geometry is clipped to map ground, not a claim that the varying road/plaza terrain or hidden foundations are flat. Heights are not rescaled to the old OSM 50 m tag.","Measured IGN roof and mapped plan are unchanged; only approved Clair material factors were updated."],"source":{"url":"/objects/c3ca94d247033ce00c039a4488661699412741f5e619300d3ccd2a50693cda2e/source.blend.gz","bytes":170685,"sha256":"c3ca94d247033ce00c039a4488661699412741f5e619300d3ccd2a50693cda2e"},"spatialSource":{"url":"/objects/87046885eca854dc366535b8d0f79df3c7c110bb3d1013feaf279c7176c0caf2/spatial-source.json","bytes":35839,"sha256":"87046885eca854dc366535b8d0f79df3c7c110bb3d1013feaf279c7176c0caf2"},"preview":{"url":"/objects/f1e8c20b03c9ebd5f36643c5248d2f3d880d636f93399a7f6a91587309076bc3/preview.webp","bytes":5538,"sha256":"f1e8c20b03c9ebd5f36643c5248d2f3d880d636f93399a7f6a91587309076bc3"},"revision":"b57d3241f0c2fe6192a0fc0e54253c171e7a05e01d190d2ab27141d537f