erred: the OSM roof layers (min_height 101-108 m) are read as a 45 degree splay of the beam soffit toward the chamfered ends, and the beam soffit is set at 91.3 m so the roof beam is as deep as the side walls (18.7 m, square frame section) as the Commons photographs show. Storey pitch 2.75 m (about 39 levels). Panoramic lift core and the Nuage sail (suspended in the void, 28-40 m up) are simplified; their dimensions are not surveyed.","Materials: stone = marble, roof = grey glass curtain wall and terrace, window = glazing, trim = reveals and mullions."],"source":{"url":"/objects/e38f9192020f77453a6ce6aec7b7220d6a3b022b88dea18e9ff39215e6dcf7cd/source.blend.gz","bytes":305057,"sha256":"e38f9192020f77453a6ce6aec7b7220d6a3b022b88dea18e9ff39215e6dcf7cd"},"spatialSource":{"url":"/objects/49e01b34777073ec461d9a4bcaa2712cbe4ebc223726ccd2b844574240c413fd/spatial-source.json","bytes":15120,"sha256":"49e01b34777073ec461d9a4bcaa2712cbe4ebc223726ccd2b844574240c413fd"},"preview":{"url":"/objects/a74b9f7b3571a6acb1e42e5cf17c8d3fcd123b579d41abf624c3a2c751a4d243/preview.webp","bytes":36234,"sha256":"a74b9f7b3571a6acb1e42e5cf17c8d3fcd123b579d41abf624c3a2c751a4d243"},"revision":"10e066891744d45ef4372e50edeeaa161b38b4b04b22cbdb74c83f5467b64912","publicationRevision":"0c6d2f83ecce76fecd6beb2399c31ba47e297ec22fce78037055b2b9b0c7d2fa","bounds":[2.2348404,48.8918899,2.2369091,48.8932391],"approved":true,"materialLibrary":{"schemaVersion":1,"sha256":"f1d437b52bbae89b4d9ee6420ea21fefbf88b8682a9254cd0b052421b0c99647","url":"/materials/f1d437b52bbae89b4d9ee6420ea21fefbf88b8682a9254cd0b052421b0c99647.json"},"metadata":"/assets/grande-arche/0c6d2f83ecce76fecd6beb2399c31ba47e297ec22fce78037055b2b9b0c7d2fa/asset.json","validation":"/assets/grande-arche/0c6d2f83ecce76fecd6beb2399c31ba47e297ec22fce78037055b2b9b0c7d2fa/validation.json"},{"id":"hyatt-regency-paris-etoile","name":"Hyatt Regency Paris Etoile","anchor":[2.2843181953569127,48.88023932932369],"heading":0,"units":"metres","axes":"X east / Y